				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/power-platform/blog/?p=135582</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Spot performance and reliability issues sooner with hourly alerts in Monitor. By checking supported health metrics hourly instead of daily, these alerts help your team identify issues across apps, flows, and agents—and respond faster when thresholds are breached.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/power-platform/blog/2026/11/11/act-faster-hourly-alerts-for-your-critical-flows-apps-and-agents/">Act faster: hourly alerts for your critical flows, apps, and agents</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/power-platform/blog">Microsoft Power Platform Blog</a>.</p>
